      "description": "Screen 5 — Badge Intro + Orbiting Engine",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(12px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n@keyframes fadeOut { 0% { opacity:1;} 100% { opacity:.35;} }\n@keyframes snapIn { 0% { transform:scale(1.6); opacity:0;} 70% { transform:scale(.92);} 100% { transform:scale(1); opacity:1;} }\n@keyframes spin { 0% { transform:rotate(0deg);} 100% { transform:rotate(360deg);} }\n@keyframes gearTurn { 0% { transform:rotate(0deg);} 100% { transform:rotate(-360deg);} }\n.negation { animation: drift .4s ease both, fadeOut .5s ease 1.1s both; }\n.n1 { animation-delay: .1s, 1.1s; } .n2 { animation-delay: .4s, 1.1s; }\n.payoff { animation: drift .5s ease 1.5s both; }\n.grid-wrap { animation: drift .5s ease .8s both; }\n.piece { animation: snapIn .6s cubic-bezier(.3,1.4,.4,1) 1.9s both; }\n.orbit { animation: spin 10s linear infinite; }\n.gear { animation: gearTurn 6s linear infinite; }\n.s1 { animation: drift .5s ease .1s both; }\n.s2 { animation: drift .5s ease .5s both; }\n.s3 { animation: drift .5s ease 1.6s both; }\n.s4 { animation: drift .5s ease 2.0s both; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--surface-2, #FFFFFF); color: var(--text-primary, #171717); padding:24px 20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<span class=\"s1\" style=\"display:inline-block; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.06em; text-transform:uppercase; background:var(--bg-accent); color:var(--text-accent); padding:5px 12px; border-radius:100px;\">Welcome to</span>\n  <p class=\"s2\" style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.25; margin:0;\">The Index Fund.</p>\n  <p class=\"s2\" style=\"font-size:13.5px; margin:0; line-height:1.5; max-width:220px;\">The most <span style=\"font-style:italic; color:var(--text-muted);\">boring, unemotional</span> wealth-building tool most people never touch.</p>\n\n  <div style=\"position:relative; width:110px; height:110px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;\">\n    <div class=\"orbit\" style=\"position:absolute; inset:0;\">\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; top:0; left:50%; background:var(--text-accent);\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; top:18%; right:6%; background:var(--text-success);\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; bottom:18%; right:6%; background:var(--text-warning);\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; bottom:0; left:50%; background:var(--text-danger);\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; bottom:18%; left:6%; background:var(--text-pro);\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; top:18%; left:6%; background:var(--text-accent);\"></div>\n</div>",
