      ],
      "correctOption": 2,
      "explanation": "Historical data shows over 75% of active mutual fund managers underperform simple, low-cost index funds over long horizons due to fees and trading costs.",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n.s1 { animation: drift .5s ease .1s both; }\n.s2 { animation: drift .5s ease .4s both; }\n.s3 { animation: drift .5s ease .7s both; }\n@keyframes gearSpin { 0% { transform:rotate(0deg);} 100% { transform:rotate(360deg);} }\n.gear-spin { animation: gearSpin 6s linear infinite; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--fill-primary, #171717); color: #FFFFFF; padding:24px 20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-settings gear-spin\" style=\"font-size:44px; color:#4F7CFF; margin:0 auto;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n\n  <p class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size:22px; font-weight:500; line-height:1.4; margin:0; color:#fff; max-width:220px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;\">Stop reading. Let's fire up the engine.</p>\n\n  <p class=\"s2\" style=\"font-size:14px; color:#fff; opacity:0.75; margin:0; max-width:210px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; line-height:1.55;\">See exactly what happens when you combine time with a simple index fund.</p>\n\n  <button class=\"s3\" style=\"width:100%; height:52px; border-radius:10px; background:#fff; color:#171717; border:none; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; margin-top:6px;\">Start the Engine</button>\n\n</div>\n</div>",
