      "description": "Screen 11 — Age Input",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n.s1 { animation: drift .5s ease .1s both; }\n.s2 { animation: drift .5s ease .35s both; }\n.s3 { animation: drift .5s ease .6s both; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:16px; text-align:center; background:var(--surface-2, #FFFFFF); color: var(--text-primary, #171717); padding:24px 20px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n<i class=\"ti ti-calendar-repeat\" style=\"font-size:28px; color:var(--text-accent); margin:0 auto;\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n\n  <p class=\"s1\" style=\"font-size:17px; font-weight:500; margin:0; line-height:1.5; max-width:220px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;\">What's the maximum amount you can realistically invest every month, without fail?</p>\n\n  <div class=\"s2\" style=\"border:1.5px solid var(--border-accent); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:16px 18px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:6px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size:26px; color:var(--text-muted);\">&#8377;</span>\n    <span style=\"font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size:32px; font-weight:700;\">5,000</span>\n    <span style=\"width:2px; height:26px; background:var(--text-accent); margin-left:2px;\"></span>\n  </div>\n\n  <p style=\"font-size:11.5px; color:var(--text-muted); margin:-8px 0 0;\">Realistic beats ambitious — you can always raise it later.</p>\n\n  <button class=\"s3\" style=\"width:100%; height:50px; border-radius:var(--radius); background:var(--fill-primary); color:var(--on-primary); border:none; font-size:15px; font-weight:500; margin-top:6px;\">Next</button>\n\n</div>\n</div>",
